==Strategy==
At first glance, this stage may look quite intimidating, featuring '''two''' St. Dobers and Starred Alien spam meaning any attempt at brute forcing them will be completely impossible. However, the low base health and Starred Alien spam are completely intentional; you're meant to use the Gardeneel Bros' warp ability to warp a powerful attacker into the enemy base, such as talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], then destroy it before the enemies get to yours.

